*.mov
*.avi
*.mkv
*.wav
*.mp3
*.flac
*.aac
*.m4a
*.ttf
*.otf
*.woff
*.woff2
*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.7z

# 文档与策划性内容（本地保留，不进核心代码仓库）
docs/
COO/
marketing/

